  "instructions": [
    "Heat the butter in the raclette grill over medium heat until melted.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the beef cubes and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the mustard seeds, yeast, tagine spice blend, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the red wine, beef broth, and tomato paste, and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a tagine and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 2 hours.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh parsley."
